        207.4549102783203,
        169.46780395507812
      ],
      "text": "Children and adolescents",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        176.6757354736328,
        527.4113159179688,
        191.1187286376953
      ],
      "text": "Children were excluded from the ZeNix trial (aged 0–13 years) and the TB-PRACTECAL trial (aged",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        189.87574768066406,
        527.2178344726562,
        204.31874084472656
      ],
      "text": "0–14 years); therefore, no analysis specific to this subgroup of patients could be performed. All",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        203.07569885253906,
        527.4344482421875,
        217.51869201660156
      ],
      "text": "medicines in the BPaLM regimen have been used in children except for pretomanid. New data on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        216.2758331298828,
        527.3759765625,
        230.7188262939453
      ],
      "text": "bedaquiline has been recently reviewed and its use has been expanded to all ages (see additional",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        228.19984436035156,
        527.4127197265625,
        243.91883850097656
      ],
      "text": "(30) recommendation in the section on longer regimens and  ). The lack of safety data on pretomanid",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        242.67579650878906,
        527.4520874023438,
        257.1188049316406
      ],
      "text": "in children aged below 14 years was the main barrier for potential extrapolation of the BPaLM/BPaL",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.8758087158203,
        527.4387817382812,
        270.3188171386719
      ],
      "text": "recommendation to the threshold of being aged below 14 years. Thus, the recommendation of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.0758056640625,
        439.79962158203125,
        283.5188293457031
      ],
      "text": "BPaLM/BPaL regimen applies to adults and adolescents aged 14 years and older.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        299.919677734375,
        190.875732421875,
        315.5796813964844
      ],
      "text": "People living with HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        322.78759765625,
        527.6141357421875,
        337.2306213378906
      ],
      "text": "HIV was diagnosed in 34 of 172 (19.8%) people enrolled in the ZeNix trial; however, it was impossible",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.99744987487793,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.98760986328125,
        527.4090576171875,
        350.4306335449219
      ],
      "text": "to perform any adjusted stratified analyses for people living with HIV (PLHIV), owing to the small",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        349.1875915527344,
        527.4256591796875,
        363.630615234375
      ],
      "text": "sample size in sub-PICO comparisons 3.2, 3.3, 3.4 and 3.5. PLHIV were eligible for enrolment in the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        362.3876037597656,
        527.4235229492188,
        376.83062744140625
      ],
      "text": "ZeNix trial if they had a CD4 count of more than 100 cells/mm  and if they were using antiretroviral  3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        375.5876159667969,
        527.5521850585938,
        390.0306396484375
      ],
      "text": "medications.  No aspects specific to HIV status or CD4 count were in the list of TB-PRACTECAL  31",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        388.78759765625,
        527.581787109375,
        403.2306213378906
      ],
      "text": "exclusion criteria, and PLHIV represented 27% of those enrolled. The median CD4 count among",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        401.98760986328125,
        403.18621826171875,
        416.4306335449219
      ],
      "text": "PLHIV was 322 (interquartile range [IQR] 217–622) across the four arms.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        423.6914978027344,
        527.6155395507812,
        438.134521484375
      ],
      "text": "It is important to take drug–drug interactions into account when administering TB and HIV medications",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.950489044189453,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        436.8915100097656,
        527.2588500976562,
        451.33453369140625
      ],
      "text": "in combination; such interactions are discussed below under implementation considerations. Although",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.961081504821777,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        450.09149169921875,
        527.4090576171875,
        464.5345153808594
      ],
      "text": "some therapies are to be avoided, there are alternative antiretroviral agents that can be considered",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        463.29150390625,
        527.1961059570312,
        477.7345275878906
      ],
      "text": "when pretomanid is used. Thus, the recommendation of the BPaLM/BPaL regimen applies to all people",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.956313133239746,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        476.49151611328125,
        527.4048461914062,
        490.9345397949219
      ],
      "text": "regardless of HIV status, although some caution should be used when enrolling patients with CD4",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        489.6914978027344,
        222.88270568847656,
        504.134521484375
      ],
      "text": "counts lower than 100 cells/mm . 3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        520.535400390625,
        269.50933837890625,
        536.1954345703125
      ],
      "text": "Pregnant and breastfeeding women",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        543.4033203125,
        527.433349609375,
        557.8463134765625
      ],
      "text": "Pregnant and breastfeeding women were excluded from the ZeNix and TB-PRACTECAL trials owing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        556.603271484375,
        527.3803100585938,
        571.0462646484375
      ],
      "text": "to unknown effects of the new medicine, pretomanid, on fetal development; therefore, no analysis",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        569.8033447265625,
        527.4367065429688,
        584.246337890625
      ],
      "text": "specific to this subgroup of patients could be performed. The use of bedaquiline in pregnancy has",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        583.00341796875,
        527.4080200195312,
        597.4464111328125
      ],
      "text": "been associated with infants born with a lower mean birth weight than infants whose mothers did",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        596.203369140625,
        527.6181640625,
        610.6463623046875
      ],
      "text": "not take bedaquiline; however, when infants were followed up over time, no evidence of late adverse",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.998000144958496,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        182.66810607910156,
        609.2933349609375,
        452.9006652832031,
        623.6483154296875
      ],
      "text": "Treatment of drug-resistant TB using longer regimens",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        609.4033203125,
        527.4200439453125,
        623.8463134765625
      ],
      "text": "impacts was found (see  ). Breastfeeding",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        621.3272705078125,
        524.3951416015625,
        637.0462646484375
      ],
      "text": "(39) is not recommended for women taking pretomanid  . Thus, the recommendation of the BPaLM/",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        635.8032836914062,
        527.5486450195312,
        650.2462768554688
      ],
      "text": "BPaL regimen does not apply to pregnant and breastfeeding women. While the safety of pretomanid",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.992547035217285,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        649.00341796875,
        481.7667541503906,
        663.4464111328125
      ],
      "text": "during pregnancy and breastfeeding is unclear, other treatment options need to be used.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        730.6719360351562,
        526.691162109375,
        744.3757934570312
      ],
      "text": "In the ZeNix trial, permitted antiretroviral treatments were nevirapine in combination with any nucleoside reverse transcriptase inhibitors  31",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 7.990044116973877,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        743.471923828125,
        526.5809326171875,
        753.9758911132812
      ],
      "text": "(NRTIs); lopinavir/ritonavir in combination with any NRTIs; tenofovir/lamivudine/abacavir (if normal renal function); triple NRTI therapy",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        753.0718994140625,
        526.5936889648438,
        763.5758666992188
      ],
      "text": "consisting of zidovudine, lamivudine and abacavir (noting the increased risk of peripheral nerve toxicity with zidovudine and linezolid);",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        762.6719360351562,
        221.43414306640625,
        773.1759033203125
      ],
      "text": "and raltegravir in combination with NRTIs.",
